#, no-wrap
msgid "Group operator terms: use the operator structure for the latest version of Qiskit bosons"
msgstr "Qiskit bosons 최신 버전에서 연산자 항 묶기: 연산자 구조 활용"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Group operator terms: use the operator structure"
msgstr "연산자 항 묶기: 연산자 구조 활용"

#. type: Plain text
